WEBVTT

01:23.390 --> 01:29.320
Black★Rock Shooter

02:49.980 --> 02:53.200
What's this? You're up impressively early.

02:53.200 --> 02:56.550
Mmhmm! Ah woke ub before m'awarm wend off.

02:56.550 --> 02:59.340
Now if only you could keep it that way.

03:04.560 --> 03:06.930
Hot, hot, hot!

03:10.790 --> 03:11.930
Mato.

03:11.930 --> 03:12.670
Hmm?

03:13.110 --> 03:14.840
Once you're done eating, could you go wake up Hiro-kun?

03:15.500 --> 03:17.770
What? I don't want to.

03:19.810 --> 03:22.750
He doesn't listen to me when I wake him up.

03:22.750 --> 03:24.020
...as the older sister?

03:26.020 --> 03:27.140
Thanks for the food!

03:34.390 --> 03:37.990
It's morning! The first day of school! Get up already!

03:40.280 --> 03:42.600
Don't blame me if you sleep through it.

03:42.760 --> 03:45.040
Seeing as how I <i>did</i> come to wake you up, okay?

04:29.380 --> 04:31.660
What's this? You're headed out already?

04:31.660 --> 04:35.020
Yup. There's a place I'd like to drop by first.

04:35.020 --> 04:38.580
I see. Sorry I can't show up for your school entrance ceremony.

04:38.580 --> 04:40.130
I told you, it's fine. Don't worry about it.

04:41.090 --> 04:43.030
Now then... I'll be on my way.

05:16.290 --> 05:19.250
Only emergency vehicles

05:16.290 --> 05:19.250
beyond this point

06:06.560 --> 06:08.480
Whoa, the train! The train!

06:29.160 --> 06:29.950
It sure is!

06:29.950 --> 06:30.820
Yeah!

06:35.890 --> 06:38.850
Entrance

06:35.890 --> 06:38.850
Ceremony

07:20.440 --> 07:24.200
For the entrance ceremony, we'll be in the middle school gym.

07:24.200 --> 07:25.840
In a few moments, as an entire class,

07:26.260 --> 07:31.150
you'll form a line and quickly sit down in your assigned seats.

07:31.150 --> 07:32.650
The assembly is a dignified one,

07:32.650 --> 07:38.280
so as students of this middle school, let us refrain from using any shameful behavior.

07:38.580 --> 07:44.810
Also, should you become ill during the ceremony, please contact the nearest teacher.

07:45.190 --> 07:49.650
You can follow along with the ceremony's progress with the pamphlets-

07:47.240 --> 07:49.650
Kotori... asobi?

08:32.030 --> 08:36.070
To all of our new students, congratulations on your admittance.

08:36.080 --> 08:39.580
I personally would like to offer my congratulations to your guardians, as well.

08:39.580 --> 08:42.290
Also, I would like to give my special thanks to-

09:04.640 --> 09:06.230
Ah, pardon!

09:07.690 --> 09:08.580
What?

09:08.580 --> 09:10.900
Ah, um...

09:11.550 --> 09:12.980
Um, right...

09:13.510 --> 09:15.100
That's right! Tall!

09:15.100 --> 09:15.940
Tall?

09:15.940 --> 09:18.830
You sure are tall!

09:19.580 --> 09:20.450
Really.

09:24.560 --> 09:27.730
Oh right, I saw you arrive in a car a while back.

09:28.450 --> 09:32.140
I was kind of moved thinking about how such people actually exist!

09:32.330 --> 09:36.710
I told him I'd be fine without it, but my dad insisted.

09:37.020 --> 09:38.350
So, it's just for today.

09:38.350 --> 09:40.050
Is your home nearby?

09:40.250 --> 09:42.050
Not quite. It's in the Machinami Ward.

09:42.050 --> 09:43.890
Eh?! That's in my neighborhood!

09:43.890 --> 09:44.800
Really?

09:44.800 --> 09:48.430
Yeah! I take the train from Kibata Station.

09:48.430 --> 09:49.360
Ah, really.

09:52.080 --> 09:57.950
The same neighborhood... Then starting tomorrow, I'll be boarding at the same station as you.

09:57.950 --> 09:59.620
Oh, that's right!

09:59.620 --> 10:02.630
But then, where did you go to elementary school?

10:02.630 --> 10:06.980
Nowhere around here. We just moved to this area recently.

10:06.980 --> 10:08.900
So that's why!

10:08.900 --> 10:09.730
What is?

10:09.730 --> 10:15.550
"Kotori-asobi" seemed like a really rare last name, so if anybody with that name lived near me, I'd definitely remember it!

10:18.540 --> 10:19.490
Takanashi.

10:19.490 --> 10:19.810
Hmm?

10:20.090 --> 10:23.500
It's read "Takanashi," but written as "Kotori-asobi."

10:23.500 --> 10:26.150
What? So, how do you get Takanashi from that?

10:26.150 --> 10:29.840
Because there are "no hawks" where "small birds play."

10:29.840 --> 10:33.420
Oh, I get it now! That's a good name!

10:33.420 --> 10:35.630
But reading it normally would be better.

10:35.630 --> 10:37.360
I think so, too.

10:37.940 --> 10:41.110
Hmm, Takanashi. Takanashi...

10:41.110 --> 10:42.330
Takanashi Yomi.

10:42.880 --> 10:43.790
My full name.

10:46.050 --> 10:48.620
Ah, I'm Kuroi Mato.

10:48.620 --> 10:49.580
Call me Mato.

10:49.870 --> 10:52.550
Mato. That's a nice name.

10:52.770 --> 10:54.800
Ah? Thanks.

10:54.800 --> 10:56.330
Uh, Mato-chan...

10:56.330 --> 10:56.800
Hmm?

10:56.800 --> 11:00.390
Our class... is right here.

11:00.390 --> 11:00.850
Oh...

11:01.420 --> 11:03.450
Ah, it sure is.

11:05.810 --> 11:08.520
Hey, where did you live before you moved?

11:08.520 --> 11:09.340
Germany.

11:09.340 --> 11:13.200
What! That would make you a returnee, wouldn't it!

11:13.200 --> 11:15.010
That's amazing!

11:15.010 --> 11:17.150
So, can you speak German and stuff?

11:17.150 --> 11:21.020
I was only in Germany for a short time, so only a little bit.

11:21.020 --> 11:23.200
Really? Let me hear some! Let me hear some!

11:23.200 --> 11:23.620
No way...

12:06.100 --> 12:07.150
Morning!

12:07.150 --> 12:08.130
Morning.

12:08.400 --> 12:10.170
Did I make you wait again?

12:10.170 --> 12:12.910
I just got here also.

12:13.150 --> 12:16.380
Even though I left out the detours to get here...

12:18.310 --> 12:20.280
Oh, did you pick a club yet?

12:20.280 --> 12:23.200
Hmm... I'm still not sure.

12:23.200 --> 12:24.090
What about you?

12:24.090 --> 12:25.210
Basketball Club.

12:25.210 --> 12:28.840
I decided that I'd do basketball as soon as I entered middle school for a while now.

12:28.840 --> 12:29.850
Is that so?

12:30.310 --> 12:33.420
Yup. How about you? Do you want to do basketball, too?

12:34.280 --> 12:36.290
You <i>are</i>  tall!

12:36.610 --> 12:38.850
I have a bit of a complex about it.

12:38.850 --> 12:39.570
Hmm?

12:39.570 --> 12:41.240
My height.

12:41.240 --> 12:43.430
I'm jealous, though!

12:43.430 --> 12:49.280
I'm pretty short, so I'm playing Basketball because I think it might make me grow a little.

12:49.280 --> 12:51.090
But you <i>do</i>  have other ones.

12:51.090 --> 12:51.980
Other what?

12:51.980 --> 12:52.950
Reasons.

12:53.680 --> 12:54.930
Guess I do.

12:54.930 --> 12:56.740
But they're not that important.

12:56.740 --> 12:59.340
Don't tell me that!

12:58.530 --> 12:59.450
Eh?

13:25.090 --> 13:26.740
So, what subjects are you good at, Yomi?

13:27.430 --> 13:28.780
English, right?

13:28.780 --> 13:30.340
Not at all.

13:30.340 --> 13:32.640
It's completely different from German.

13:34.100 --> 13:38.000
I wouldn't say I'm good at it, but I rather enjoy math.

13:38.000 --> 13:41.480
So there's really somebody out there that likes math...

13:41.480 --> 13:44.400
What about you, Mato? What subjects are you good in?

13:44.400 --> 13:45.930
It just so happens...

13:45.930 --> 13:47.600
that I'm about to find out.

13:47.770 --> 13:51.800
My greatest strength at the moment is PE, and everything else is pretty much average.

14:25.960 --> 14:26.840
Here!

14:30.000 --> 14:31.830
Nice shot.

14:32.460 --> 14:34.020
Okay, take five.

14:34.490 --> 14:36.480
You're pretty good.

14:36.480 --> 14:38.070
Did you play basketball somewhere else before?

14:38.070 --> 14:42.630
Yes! During elementary school, I played with some boys at the park.

14:42.630 --> 14:44.350
Good enough!

14:44.350 --> 14:46.100
All right, let's start the next one!

14:46.100 --> 14:46.740
Okay!

15:06.620 --> 15:08.630
Yomi!

15:08.630 --> 15:10.850
Let me copy that!

15:11.520 --> 15:15.100
It looks like I'm going to be called on today.

15:15.100 --> 15:18.060
If you don't do it yourself, you won't be able to remember it.

15:21.270 --> 15:26.080
Aw, Yomi! I love you!

15:24.270 --> 15:26.070
Stop it, Mato, that tickles.

15:26.070 --> 15:27.570
Stop it, Mato, that tickles.

15:35.850 --> 15:36.790
Mato.

15:36.950 --> 15:37.850
Hmm?

15:38.240 --> 15:40.580
I've decided which club I'm going to join.

15:42.390 --> 15:44.090
It's not the Basketball Club, but...

15:44.480 --> 15:45.670
Well, it's something similar.

15:56.690 --> 15:58.360
You've got good sense for this.

15:58.360 --> 15:59.860
Thank you very much.

16:56.890 --> 16:57.880
Thanks for waiting!

16:57.880 --> 16:59.090
No problem!

16:59.090 --> 17:00.400
Good work out there!

17:01.710 --> 17:03.200
Shall we go somewhere today?

17:03.200 --> 17:04.750
Sounds good to me.

17:12.280 --> 17:15.090
You're the older sister, so there's no getting around it, right?

17:15.090 --> 17:18.800
Don't you start saying stuff like my mom does!

17:21.240 --> 17:22.100
Oh, it's from home.

17:23.150 --> 17:24.390
Pardon me for a moment.

17:25.410 --> 17:26.640
Hello?

17:26.640 --> 17:27.400
Yes, Mom?

17:28.640 --> 17:29.770
Everything's fine. Right now?

17:30.120 --> 17:33.050
I'm still with her.

17:33.410 --> 17:35.580
This one's pretty cute!

17:35.580 --> 17:37.260
It really is.

17:47.610 --> 17:48.440
Hey...

17:49.840 --> 17:51.680
Are you still all right on time?

17:51.680 --> 17:53.100
I should be fine.

17:53.420 --> 17:55.780
There's somewhere I want to take you!

17:55.780 --> 17:56.700
Is that okay?

17:56.700 --> 17:57.580
Sure.

17:57.580 --> 17:58.180
This way!

17:58.980 --> 18:00.300
This way, this way!

18:00.300 --> 18:01.600
Hey, wait up!

18:34.390 --> 18:35.750
It's right here!

18:36.320 --> 18:37.220
Take a look!

18:43.640 --> 18:46.510
This is my favorite place.

18:47.570 --> 18:52.980
Somehow when I look at the town from up here, I feel like it just cheers you up.

18:53.700 --> 18:56.000
And not just because it's a nice view.

18:56.290 --> 18:59.710
Ah... It's tough to explain.

19:00.300 --> 19:02.560
But... do you kind of see it?

19:02.560 --> 19:04.350
Yes, I understand.

19:05.570 --> 19:08.040
Mato, you like this town, don't you.

19:08.040 --> 19:10.400
Yeah. I love it.

19:11.380 --> 19:14.090
It's the place where I was born and raised.

19:14.780 --> 19:16.060
I'm envious.

19:16.690 --> 19:19.740
I've been moving constantly from a young age.

19:24.270 --> 19:26.390
Stay here from now on.

19:26.390 --> 19:28.220
I'd hate to see you leave.

19:31.040 --> 19:33.960
Yeah. I'd like to.

19:36.510 --> 19:37.530
Ah...

19:40.030 --> 19:41.330
I'll give this to you.

19:42.430 --> 19:43.380
This...

19:43.870 --> 19:45.250
Cute, isn't it!

19:45.250 --> 19:47.270
I bought it from the store we were just at.

19:47.970 --> 19:49.500
I can have it?

19:49.500 --> 19:50.380
Yeah!

19:50.380 --> 19:53.840
I mean, you don't have anything for your cell phone, right?

19:54.110 --> 19:56.150
We wouldn't want it to be lonely.

19:57.630 --> 19:58.550
Look!

19:59.130 --> 20:01.540
I've got one just like it right here.

20:01.790 --> 20:02.760
You like it?

20:05.300 --> 20:07.970
Thank you. I'll treasure it.

20:07.970 --> 20:08.790
Sure!

21:22.940 --> 21:24.400
Closing
Ceremony

21:25.840 --> 21:27.800
Report Card

21:25.840 --> 21:27.800
1 year B class

21:25.840 --> 21:27.800
Kuroi Mato

22:49.290 --> 22:50.480
Here!

22:51.120 --> 22:51.680
Here!

22:57.110 --> 22:58.250
Mato!

23:00.090 --> 23:01.780
Did the shock from your landing make it act up?

23:01.780 --> 23:03.100
Seems like it.

23:03.250 --> 23:04.230
Can you stand?

23:04.230 --> 23:05.140
Yeah.

23:05.140 --> 23:06.330
Are you all right?

23:06.450 --> 23:07.890
I'm fine, I'm fine.

23:09.320 --> 23:10.600
Yomi!

23:10.850 --> 23:12.190
Don't get lazy, now!

23:12.190 --> 23:12.870
Right!

23:13.470 --> 23:14.830
Suck it up!

23:21.340 --> 23:22.750
Right here's fine.

23:22.750 --> 23:23.580
You sure?

23:24.210 --> 23:25.850
Sorry to keep you waiting!

23:25.850 --> 23:26.830
Not at all.

23:27.130 --> 23:29.150
Is your leg okay?

23:29.150 --> 23:31.950
Yeah, it's just a minor sprain.

23:31.950 --> 23:36.890
Our excellent manager taped it up, so it doesn't hurt now.

23:36.890 --> 23:39.270
Hiya! I'm the excellent manager.

23:39.790 --> 23:44.620
It should heal up pretty soon, but for now you shouldn't try to run or jump.

23:44.620 --> 23:48.290
Keep today's bath short, and don't let that leg get hot water on it.

23:49.420 --> 23:50.590
Yes, yes.

23:50.590 --> 23:52.730
And you won't be participating in practice tomorrow.

23:52.730 --> 23:55.060
What? Anything but that!

23:55.060 --> 23:58.960
Listen to what I'm telling you! You promising first-year ace!

23:58.960 --> 24:01.500
That's embarrassing, stop it.

24:01.500 --> 24:04.550
Well, I've got other things I still need to do.

24:04.550 --> 24:05.280
Bye-bye.

24:05.280 --> 24:06.050
Thank you.

24:07.160 --> 24:09.420
First-year ace, hmm?

24:09.420 --> 24:10.890
I'm really not!

24:11.350 --> 24:15.000
But they might let me participate in the spring tournament, though.

24:15.000 --> 24:17.180
Really? Do your best, okay?

24:17.180 --> 24:18.890
I will!

24:28.010 --> 24:30.440
We got put in different classes.

24:30.940 --> 24:31.850
Yeah.

24:32.640 --> 24:36.710
But our classes are right next to each other, and our clubs are right next to each other.

24:36.860 --> 24:37.540
Yeah.

24:37.840 --> 24:40.580
We'll be able to see each other whenever we have time off.

24:40.870 --> 24:41.700
Yeah.

24:46.590 --> 24:47.960
There's nothing we can do, huh?

24:49.120 --> 24:50.810
There's nothing we can do.

25:06.620 --> 25:08.540
How's the new class?

25:08.540 --> 25:11.260
Hmm? Average, I'd say.

25:11.260 --> 25:12.480
Isn't it?!

25:12.600 --> 25:16.830
It still doesn't feel like we're juniors.

25:16.830 --> 25:22.290
Although, with the new freshmen joining the clubs, we should feel it pretty soon.

25:22.540 --> 25:24.200
I guess so.

25:26.580 --> 25:28.050
Did you get a bit taller?

25:28.140 --> 25:29.750
Eh? Really?

25:30.460 --> 25:33.110
I'm still not really catching up to you.

25:34.140 --> 25:35.260
Hey, Yomi.

25:35.260 --> 25:36.300
Hmm?

25:36.300 --> 25:38.560
Don't grow any taller, okay?

25:38.550 --> 25:41.260
I don't think there's much I can do about it-

25:44.150 --> 25:45.540
Mato, do you have a moment?

25:45.540 --> 25:46.620
Yuu!

25:46.770 --> 25:51.380
Before we get to our club activities we're having a meeting, and you better not be late.

25:51.690 --> 25:53.240
What meeting?

25:53.240 --> 25:55.010
Introducing the new members.

25:55.010 --> 25:57.210
The promising prospects. You see...

25:57.380 --> 26:00.360
we've got to make sure they don't get snatched up by the Volleyball Club.

26:00.600 --> 26:04.040
The president's getting fired up just thinking of counter-plans.

26:05.590 --> 26:07.800
Ah, Yomi! This girl's Yuu.

26:07.800 --> 26:10.760
You know her, right? The Basketball Club's manager.

26:10.760 --> 26:13.630
We ended up in the same class this time around.

26:13.630 --> 26:15.630
Nice to meet you, Takanashi-san.

26:16.140 --> 26:18.820
Can I call you Yomi, too?

26:20.840 --> 26:22.100
Okay, okay.

26:22.100 --> 26:24.350
Call me Yuu, if y'please.

26:24.350 --> 26:24.890
See 'ya.

26:32.940 --> 26:35.610
All right! Go get 'em!

26:41.220 --> 26:42.480
Hey, you want to come over after this?

26:42.480 --> 26:43.990
I definitely do!

26:44.420 --> 26:49.380
Did you hear the story about what Yamamura-senpai did after practice was over?

26:49.380 --> 26:54.540
I did, I did! The one about her using the springboard to practice dunks.

26:54.540 --> 26:55.350
Haha, yeah!

26:55.350 --> 26:56.340
Ah, Yomi!

26:56.340 --> 26:57.940
Good work!

26:59.180 --> 27:02.310
So yeah, Yamamura-senpai...

27:02.310 --> 27:06.040
When the captain told me about it, I laughed so hard I ended up crying.

27:06.040 --> 27:12.390
When she jumped, rather than getting the ball in, she got her head in instead!

27:12.390 --> 27:14.520
How high did she jump?

27:14.520 --> 27:18.000
I came up with this image of her coming down through the net,

27:18.000 --> 27:20.540
and I was laughing so hard, I was rolling on the floor.

27:20.540 --> 27:22.730
I thought my stomach muscles were going to break!

27:23.170 --> 27:27.790
She's a good senpai, but on occasion she does some pretty odd stuff.

27:27.790 --> 27:31.580
Yeah, and the captain's way of telling it is great.

27:31.580 --> 27:34.040
You can't help but laugh.

27:34.230 --> 27:36.130
Well, I'm headed off this way.

27:36.130 --> 27:38.030
See you tomorrow!

27:39.290 --> 27:44.200
I really can't put Yamamura's epic feats into words that well.

27:44.500 --> 27:45.630
It's irritating!

27:46.440 --> 27:47.440
Yeah.

27:48.740 --> 27:52.490
Oh... I guess you wouldn't really get all of this talk about the Basketball Club.

27:52.670 --> 27:54.690
Sorry.

27:55.130 --> 27:58.090
Ah, no, that's not it.

27:58.230 --> 28:01.780
I guess I... just started spacing out.

28:01.780 --> 28:02.930
Really?

28:02.930 --> 28:03.600
Yeah.

28:28.910 --> 28:30.510
What's wrong?

28:30.510 --> 28:32.340
What? Oh, nothing...

30:32.940 --> 30:34.340
Sorry about the wait!

30:35.310 --> 30:36.150
Good work!

30:36.150 --> 30:40.280
Sorry... The captain just went on and on.

30:40.440 --> 30:42.670
Did you happen to see Yomi?

30:42.670 --> 30:43.820
Nope...

30:53.370 --> 30:55.660
<i>Hmm? You didn't hear from her?</i>

30:55.940 --> 30:58.610
She said she had something to do today, so she went home early.

30:59.900 --> 31:03.590
It must've been pretty urgent if she didn't tell <i>you</i>  about it.

31:04.260 --> 31:06.400
No need to make that face.

31:06.400 --> 31:07.740
Yeah!

31:09.800 --> 31:10.580
Good work today.

31:10.580 --> 31:11.750
You too!

32:10.110 --> 32:13.110
What happened today ?

32:10.110 --> 32:13.110
I was worried since you didn't

32:10.110 --> 32:13.110
tell me anything...

32:10.110 --> 32:13.110
But don't worry about that.

32:10.110 --> 32:13.110
See you tomorrow !

32:13.110 --> 32:13.240
tell me anything...

32:13.110 --> 32:13.240
See you tomorrow !

32:13.120 --> 32:13.240
What happened today ?

32:13.120 --> 32:13.240
I was worried since you didn't

32:13.120 --> 32:13.240
But don't worry about that.

32:13.240 --> 32:13.490
What happened today ?

32:13.240 --> 32:13.490
I was worried since you didn't

32:13.240 --> 32:13.490
tell me anything...

32:13.240 --> 32:13.490
But don't worry about that.

32:13.240 --> 32:13.490
See you tomorrow !

32:13.490 --> 32:14.820
Sending...

32:22.140 --> 32:24.640
Nee-chan, dinner's ready.

32:24.640 --> 32:26.200
Coming.

33:37.950 --> 33:38.820
Good morning.

33:38.820 --> 33:39.240
Good morning.

33:39.240 --> 33:40.450
Good morning.

33:40.450 --> 33:42.330
Good morning.

33:42.330 --> 33:42.910
Sending...

33:57.130 --> 33:57.890
Hey-

33:57.870 --> 33:58.540
Hmm?

33:58.540 --> 34:00.590
Do you know anything about what happened to Yomi?

34:00.780 --> 34:02.210
Takanashi-san?

34:03.060 --> 34:05.200
Come to think of it, she isn't here today, huh?

34:06.450 --> 34:09.560
Aren't you friends with her?

34:09.560 --> 34:11.040
Maybe you should try sending her a text?

34:11.330 --> 34:13.260
Ah, that's right.

34:13.260 --> 34:14.250
Thanks.

34:17.110 --> 34:19.130
Rise! Bow!

34:33.140 --> 34:34.640
Mother

34:39.640 --> 34:42.640
Mother

34:39.640 --> 34:42.640
To Mato

34:39.640 --> 34:42.640
Today, after school is over

34:39.640 --> 34:42.640
I will get in touch soon

34:39.640 --> 34:42.640
Takanashi-san

34:45.140 --> 34:45.770
police

34:46.140 --> 34:46.640
missing

35:17.920 --> 35:19.410
Ah... welcome back.

35:20.400 --> 35:21.560
I'm home.

35:21.970 --> 35:24.390
Some detectives are waiting for you upstairs.

35:28.190 --> 35:31.250
You may have already heard from your mother, but...

35:31.250 --> 35:36.140
Takanashi Yomi's parents have given us the task of searching for their daughter.

35:36.790 --> 35:39.150
We received the report last night.

35:39.850 --> 35:45.580
Yesterday morning, Yomi-san left for school and never returned.

35:45.990 --> 35:50.330
During our investigation, we've confirmed that she left school in the early evening.

35:50.510 --> 35:54.280
However, we don't have any further leads.

35:54.930 --> 35:58.630
At the moment, we have no idea if she could have been involved in an accident...

35:58.630 --> 36:00.440
or if she set out on her own volition.

36:00.440 --> 36:03.300
In short, whether or not she just simply ran away.

36:03.300 --> 36:05.440
We can't really be certain at the moment.

36:05.440 --> 36:10.450
There's... there's no way Yomi would ever run away from home.

36:10.840 --> 36:14.840
Hmm... We heard the same thing from her parents.

36:14.840 --> 36:16.890
That they just couldn't understand why this would happen.

36:16.890 --> 36:19.760
But... we still have to consider the possibility.

36:19.760 --> 36:24.170
We heard that you are Yomi's closest friend.

36:24.170 --> 36:26.800
If you have any idea of her whereabouts or her intentions, anything...

36:26.800 --> 36:29.400
Is there anything that comes to mind?

36:32.760 --> 36:33.820
Mato.

36:36.050 --> 36:37.440
Yesterday...

36:38.360 --> 36:44.010
Yomi and I always take the train together, but she wasn't there.

36:45.390 --> 36:49.310
One of the Volleyball Club members told me that she said she had to go home early.

36:50.780 --> 36:52.590
I sent her a text message...

36:53.340 --> 36:55.020
but I haven't gotten a response...

36:59.180 --> 37:02.140
Did anything seem off about her at school?

37:02.140 --> 37:05.100
At... say, during break.

39:24.110 --> 39:26.140
Did you hear about what happened to that Takanashi girl?

39:26.140 --> 39:29.050
I heard! They say she disappeared.

39:29.050 --> 39:31.200
Could it be... a kidnapping?

39:31.200 --> 39:34.410
She didn't seem like the type to just run away from home like that.

39:34.410 --> 39:37.740
She seemed pretty refined, and her parents are probably rich...

39:37.740 --> 39:39.020
Scary!

39:39.300 --> 39:41.980
I don't think it's been on the news, though.

39:41.980 --> 39:44.710
Maybe they don't want to anger the kidnapper?

39:44.710 --> 39:47.500
Scary! I'd better be more careful, too!

39:47.500 --> 39:50.540
Huh? I didn't think you were that rich.

39:50.540 --> 39:52.300
I'm not, but still...

39:52.300 --> 39:54.700
Well, I guess I don't have anything to worry about.

40:07.190 --> 40:10.010
Mato... cheer up, will you?

40:10.010 --> 40:12.330
I'm telling you, Yomi will be back before you know it.

40:12.330 --> 40:14.790
I'm sure she has some sort of situation to deal with.

40:16.000 --> 40:18.810
Don't tell me... you think this is your fault?

40:18.810 --> 40:19.610
What?

40:20.220 --> 40:22.250
There's no way it could be!

40:22.250 --> 40:25.000
I'm telling you to stop moping already!

40:25.000 --> 40:28.440
When you're looking down like that, it rubs off on me!

40:28.440 --> 40:31.070
It's the same for the rest of the people in the Basketball Club.

40:31.630 --> 40:36.560
Everyone's just as worried about Yomi as you are.

40:36.830 --> 40:37.950
Sorry.

40:37.950 --> 40:40.090
Come on, you don't need to apologize.

40:40.090 --> 40:44.620
When Yomi comes back, she'll feel bad if we worried this much.

40:44.620 --> 40:50.190
So we've got to believe she's coming back, and stay positive. Okay?

40:50.590 --> 40:51.430
Sure.

40:51.690 --> 40:53.180
Thanks, Yuu.

40:53.180 --> 40:54.800
It's fine, it's fine!

40:54.800 --> 40:56.700
Now let's go all-out at the club!

40:56.940 --> 40:58.720
Yeah, let's do it.

41:34.630 --> 41:35.890
Yomi?!

41:38.300 --> 41:39.760
Yomi

41:38.300 --> 41:39.760
(No subject)

41:52.640 --> 41:53.740
What is this supposed to mean?

41:55.460 --> 41:56.560
Yomi...

42:09.610 --> 42:10.850
Mato?

42:11.150 --> 42:13.120
Wait, Mato, where are you going?

42:13.120 --> 42:13.950
Yomi!

42:16.170 --> 42:17.180
To where Yomi is.

42:37.700 --> 42:39.240
Only emergency vehicles

42:37.700 --> 42:39.240
beyond this point

43:21.550 --> 43:23.430
Yomi, where are you?

43:25.320 --> 43:26.880
Where are you?

46:13.970 --> 46:15.130
What...

46:16.010 --> 46:17.100
is this place?

46:32.080 --> 46:33.980
Do you want to save that girl?

46:36.650 --> 46:39.310
The one who's precious to you...

46:40.140 --> 46:42.800
The one who finds you precious to them...

46:44.230 --> 46:45.530
You mean Yomi?

46:46.210 --> 46:47.780
Where is Yomi?

46:50.520 --> 46:51.950
It's not that I want to save her...

46:54.090 --> 46:56.200
I just want to walk with her again!

46:56.700 --> 46:59.650
I want to laugh with her again!

47:00.460 --> 47:03.400
I want to see Yomi again, right now!

47:04.590 --> 47:05.800
I see.

47:16.090 --> 47:17.630
Who are you?

47:21.940 --> 47:23.110
Who...

47:24.150 --> 47:25.400
are you?

47:27.790 --> 47:29.360
I am...

47:31.960 --> 47:33.300
I am...

47:35.770 --> 47:37.860
Black Rock Shooter.

51:47.610 --> 51:48.570
Bye!

51:48.570 --> 51:49.640
Bye!

51:51.130 --> 51:53.210
So then, that senpai went and-

51:56.340 --> 51:59.070
She tried to dunk like that again?

52:00.780 --> 52:02.330
What are you doing?

52:02.560 --> 52:04.390
Yuu, hurry and get over here!
